cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Independent verification of publicly deposited prion-disease datasets (Projeto DCJ - Lito)"
authors:
  - alias: BlackYuriJDU
    collab: "Projeto DCJ - Lito"
version: v1.0.0-preprint
date-released: "2026-08-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BlackYuriJDU/dcj-lito"
abstract: "End-to-end independent reanalysis of the largest sCJD GWAS (GCST90001389) from summary statistics: all three published loci replicate; cluster-level fine-mapping with 1000G LD via Ensembl REST; stratified genomic-inflation diagnostics; exact replication of brain-expression signature (GSE160208); covariate-adjusted reassessment of blood miRNA signature (GSE140069). Pure standard-library Python."
keywords:
  - prion disease
  - Creutzfeldt-Jakob
  - GWAS replication
  - fine-mapping
  - open science
